    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rescue princesses, others save the whole world. But here, you save the schnitzel! <br><br>In &quot;Super Chipflake \u00dc: Quest for the Uncooked Schnitzel&quot;, your stomach is rumbling, and there's only one solution \u2013 find the ingredients and cook the world-famous schnitzel! But even in Schl\u00e4nd, the schnitzel-loving country, it won't be easy! <br><br>Embark on a quirky adventure filled with unexpected encounters, platforming challenges and a fun merging mechanic. Explore a world brimmed with secrets, strange characters, and even stranger problems. Dig, swing, and sprint your way through a lovingly designed environment, where surprises await around every corner. <br><br><strong>Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Schl\u00e4nd</strong> - a compact yet densely packed country, packed with meaningful exploration and adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and help the locals</strong> - from clueless cats to other helpless creatures, everyone has a problem and they all are counting on you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge and create</strong> - combine items in creative ways to overcome obstacles and craft new ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools </strong>- dig up treasures with your shovel, uncover hidden places with the grappling hook, or speed through Schl\u00e4nd with your running shoes</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rescue princesses, others save the whole world. But here, you save the schnitzel! <br><br>In &quot;Super Chipflake \u00dc: Quest for the Uncooked Schnitzel&quot;, your stomach is rumbling, and there's only one solution \u2013 find the ingredients and cook the world-famous schnitzel! But even in Schl\u00e4nd, the schnitzel-loving country, it won't be easy! <br><br>Embark on a quirky adventure filled with unexpected encounters, platforming challenges and a fun merging mechanic. Explore a world brimmed with secrets, strange characters, and even stranger problems. Dig, swing, and sprint your way through a lovingly designed environment, where surprises await around every corner. <br><br><strong>Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Schl\u00e4nd</strong> - a compact yet densely packed country, packed with meaningful exploration and adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and help the locals</strong> - from clueless cats to other helpless creatures, everyone has a problem and they all are counting on you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge and create</strong> - combine items in creative ways to overcome obstacles and craft new ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools </strong>- dig up treasures with your shovel, uncover hidden places with the grappling hook, or speed through Schl\u00e4nd with your running shoes</p></li></ul>",
